&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;US President Donald Trump on Saturday said Washington would decide its next course of action on Iran, warning that the outcome would come either the &quot;easy way or the hard way&quot; while claiming that Tehran had been &quot;decimated&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&quot;We have a decision that I'll make about Iran. Iran's been decimated. So the only question is, it'll either be the easy way or the hard way. We'll have it the easy way or the hard way,&quot; Trump told reporters outside the White House.&lt;/p&gt;
